      "content": "i feel like im just disappearing lately. not like i'm actually leaving, but like everything that made me \"me\" is just fading away. i look back at my memories and they feel like they belong to a stranger. it's like im a house and the lights are just going out one by one... and soon its just gonna be dark.",
